# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sovereign Distillery Thesis — repository ignore rules
#
# NOTE (TR-1): runs/ holds BOTH bulk training/generation logs (never commit)
# AND the small JSON evidence profiles that EVIDENCE_REGISTER.md requires in
# order to promote MEASURED-REPORTED claims to MEASURED. The carve-out below
# keeps the bulk out while letting the evidence in.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Python / training environments
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local model/training artifacts
checkpoints/
corpora/
deploy/
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth

# Run outputs — bulk excluded, evidence profiles retained
runs/*
!runs/*.json
runs/**/*.log
runs/**/*.jsonl
runs/**/*.csv

# registry/ is intentionally NOT ignored: registry/teachers.json is a required
# evidence artifact (EVIDENCE_REGISTER item 2). Before making this repository
# public, review it for local-path and inventory disclosure (TR-8).

# Secrets / environment
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
